++++++Subject: [PATCH 02/17] Guard self.norm for non-final pipeline stages
++++++
++++++apply_pp_boundaries sets norm to None on every stage but the last
++++++(pipeline_parallel.py:161) to avoid keeping a ~1.9 GB head resident on the
++++++seven stages that never use it. GlmMoeDsaModel.forward called it
